cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or its dataset, please cite it as below.
title: 'STS Interactive Map: an atlas of the history and philosophy of science'
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: McDonald
    given-names: Aluinn
repository-code: 'https://github.com/aluinn/STS-interactive-map'
url: 'https://sts-interactive-map.vercel.app'
abstract: >-
  An interactive atlas of how scientific ideas moved between cultures, cities,
  institutions and historical periods, keeping the philosophy of science in the
  same frame as the history. Four views (Atlas, Timeline, Debates, Paths) over
  one typed, referentially checked dataset.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - history of science
  - philosophy of science
  - science and technology studies
  - digital humanities
  - interactive map
